OL,6,     FBy hosting this week's trilateral
OL,7,     Fsummit, Xi Jinping has cemented
OL,8,     FChina's place on the world stage.
OL,9,     FMark Coles explores Xi's
OL,10,     Fupbringing, his political vision
OL,11,     Fand future ambitions.
